      "side": 1,
      "message": "Can we avoid using \"ensure\" in task names, in exchange for more descriptive wording?\n\nFor example:  \"symlink cord and cord_profile directories to /opt\", \"Create ssh key if one doesn\u0027t exist\", and \"Add created public key authorized keys\"\n\nI\u0027m fine with using \"ensure\" when we make an assertion about the state of the system.",
