      "writtenOn": "2017-08-18T22:44:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think \u0027ensure\u0027 is a pretty standard way of describing the desired end-state of a declaratively-specified task. Your examples are more imperative, describing what needs to be done to achieve that end state.",
